{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12910","headline":"送李中丞赴商州 · 韩翃","name":"送李中丞赴商州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五马渭桥东，连嘶逐晓风。\n当年紫髯将，他日黑头公。\n不异金吾宠，兼齐玉帐雄。\n闭营春雪下，吹角暮山空。\n香麝松阴里，寒猨黛色中。\n郡斋多赏事，好与故人同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}